THIRD PARTY COMPONENTS
======================

The APK bundles prebuilt binaries that are redistributed unmodified:

  * proot, loader, loader32, libtalloc.so.2, libandroid-shmem.so
    - from the Termux project (https://github.com/termux/proot)
    - proot is GPL-2.0; libtalloc is LGPL-3.0; libandroid-shmem is Apache-2.0
    - the loader helper is extracted by the app at runtime

  * The Ubuntu 26.04 rootfs is not redistributed in this repository. It is
    built from Canonical's ubuntu-base image and Ubuntu archive packages by
    tools/build_rootfs.sh, and each package keeps its own licence. Ubuntu is
    licensed under the GPL/LPPL/BSD mix described by the Ubuntu archive.
